      "text": "Categorical Quantum Volume Operator — 17 sections: Categorical Quantum Volume Operato; Introduction; The Volume Operator in Loop Quantu\n\n**Categorical Quantum Volume Operator**\n\n*Alexander Hahn ,1, ∗Sebastian Murk ,2, † Sukhbinder Singh,3, ‡ and Gavin K. Brennen*\n\n19 pp, 17 sections.\n\n**Outline.** Categorical Quantum Volume Operator; Introduction; The Volume Operator in Loop Quantum Gravity; Spin networks and graph states; Quantum tetrahedron; Volume operator; Chakrabarti's derivation of the volume operato; Categorification of the Volume Operator; String diagrams; Derivation of the categorical volume operator; Beyond ribbon fusion categories; Hermiticity of the categorical volume operator; Recovering the Standard SU(2) Volume Operator; Spectrum of the SU(2)k Volume Operator; Discussion and Conclusions; References; Appendix: Basic Concepts in Category Theory",
